{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_412ef1f667382f3ef812c8498ab5b40ba4f85182f41f8b31298e14a44cd8eec4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per the README, Windows builds are not yet available; Linux x64 AppImage is experimental, with macOS the primary target."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4d48112cee747b6ee534dd7c5468f10c4887892f9163c2e1c1aa230789ffcc98"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent sessions can be scheduled as automations, e.g. overnight issue triage, changelog drafting, or dependency freshness tasks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_608904044747fbcba50a6a2aed5c8482f182a23dab479c18ed4a13708e305639"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Superset runs CLI-based coding agents in parallel, each isolated in its own git worktree with its own branch, terminal, and environment."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6ca490113567e120064980146f89d49054a87981caa05a987ed0fc0db32d3dcc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tech stack is described as Electron, React, Tailwind, Bun, Turborepo, Vite, Biome, Drizzle ORM, Neon, and tRPC."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9e4d34f44a781e92dc045a706f7eca8409b2b1c61bdb3d22625e550b8b3916a4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors run `./.superset/setup.local.sh` then `bun run dev`; the setup script brings up local Postgres plus Electric via Docker and seeds a dev account, requiring Bun 1.3.14+, docker, jq, and caddy."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ae6e5ee6b9906fa9329629d30e11d3b9ae9c9dd14665bc76aba7745ed47d102b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents come pre-loaded with `superset:*` skills (orchestrating parallel agents, scheduling automations, filing feedback, diagnosing issues) provisioned automatically at launch."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cdf7a99d30c1a333a06c24bfb3f0122d0d213cfd3946fe1f6b499d201b2988bf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The desktop app includes a built-in terminal (splits, persistent sessions, rich prompt editor), a diff viewer for reviewing and committing agent changes, and an in-app browser with per-workspace port detection."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ce8f3063791b3e38c027cd9d4087fa6f0e412debc4840830d93f4afa6c2b8bc1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The only hard runtime prerequisite stated is Git; the GitHub CLI (gh) is optional and unlocks PR workflows, with Superset offering to install it."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fef957afcc1973e2e0465fccfd8a15789b7e043672202ba71ae9dd628253dae2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product ships multiple surfaces: a desktop app, a single `superset` CLI binary, a TypeScript SDK (@superset_sh/sdk), and an MCP server that lets agents create and manage workspaces."}],"claim_ids":["clm_412ef1f667382f3ef812c8498ab5b40ba4f85182f41f8b31298e14a44cd8eec4","clm_4d48112cee747b6ee534dd7c5468f10c4887892f9163c2e1c1aa230789ffcc98","clm_608904044747fbcba50a6a2aed5c8482f182a23dab479c18ed4a13708e305639","clm_6ca490113567e120064980146f89d49054a87981caa05a987ed0fc0db32d3dcc","clm_9e4d34f44a781e92dc045a706f7eca8409b2b1c61bdb3d22625e550b8b3916a4","clm_ae6e5ee6b9906fa9329629d30e11d3b9ae9c9dd14665bc76aba7745ed47d102b","clm_cdf7a99d30c1a333a06c24bfb3f0122d0d213cfd3946fe1f6b499d201b2988bf","clm_ce8f3063791b3e38c027cd9d4087fa6f0e412debc4840830d93f4afa6c2b8bc1","clm_fef957afcc1973e2e0465fccfd8a15789b7e043672202ba71ae9dd628253dae2"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_d3e8e1b351064a13aaad3dea45c5038d","id":"pg_690d0d79b8205360ac9d6f05e58eef09","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/superset-sh-superset-readme-md-ed42524ed1d4-6f05e58eef09.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_2e00f5e8a11e5b39908f5cc1a72c2fc0"],"title":"superset-sh/superset/README.md @ ed42524ed1d4","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d3e8e1b351064a13aaad3dea45c5038d"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1ef29b0721e24c4eee120122512fe24a90917bc06f83c3ad641258f8d8ab9232"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: AGENTS.md prescribes a component folder layout (one folder per component, co-located tests, barrel exports), Lingui-based i18n with `bun run check:i18n` enforced in CI, and a rule against hand-editing generated Drizzle migration files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6ca490113567e120064980146f89d49054a87981caa05a987ed0fc0db32d3dcc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tech stack is described as Electron, React, Tailwind, Bun, Turborepo, Vite, Biome, Drizzle ORM, Neon, and tRPC."},{"claim_ids":["clm_95ea37020f92407860938d24ec99da935c1134eb7fee751a3d5d241a4c41579a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: plugin releases are git tags `<name>@<version>`; publishing rewrites `.agent-marketplace.json` and generated manifests, and `bun run check:plugins` runs in CI to catch skipped publish steps."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1ef29b0721e24c4eee120122512fe24a90917bc06f83c3ad641258f8d8ab9232","clm_6ca490113567e120064980146f89d49054a87981caa05a987ed0fc0db32d3dcc","clm_95ea37020f92407860938d24ec99da935c1134eb7fee751a3d5d241a4c41579a"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:41Z","created_by_operation":"op_d3e8e1b351064a13aaad3dea45c5038d","id":"pg_910ab8e36ad75166bbfcd794d880efe2","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/superset-sh-superset-agents-md-ed42524ed1d4-d794d880efe2.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_3ef3c660141857748042e27e883ba4a6"],"title":"superset-sh/superset/AGENTS.md @ ed42524ed1d4","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:16:41Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d3e8e1b351064a13aaad3dea45c5038d"}
